ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/202608302311147289_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/202608302311147289_720.jpg"> </div><p>【比赛战报】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/match2067663date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">B费3球1助！曼联5-2逆转伊镇取首胜 库尼亚助攻+造点马奎尔造乌龙</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9449f679e50native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">英超积分榜：曼联逆转伊镇取首胜，热刺暂垫底！明晨枪手客战维拉</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.57" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2067663_1788111089_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.57" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.57" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2067663_1788111089_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2067663_1788111089_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>曼联5-2逆转战胜伊普斯维奇，取得新赛季英超首胜。B费本场斩获帽子戏法以及一次助攻！</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/match2075430date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅三连胜！皇马4-0马拉加 贝林一条龙破门+造乌龙姆巴佩建功</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2075430_1788109165_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2075430_1788109165_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2075430_1788109165_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>皇马4-0马拉加豪取三连胜暂登榜首。本场皇马多点开花，贝林一条龙破门+造乌龙，姆巴佩建功。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-30/match2067658date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">两连胜！切尔西4-3终结对布莱顿四连败 佩德罗传射大马丁4扑救</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.59" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067658_1788102099_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.59" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.59" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067658_1788102099_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067658_1788102099_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>切尔西4-3击败布莱顿，开赛两连胜的同时，终结对阵布莱顿的四连败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-30/match2067661date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">利兹联1-1布伦特福德均2轮不败 沙德外脚背建功 勒温救主罗登伤退</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067661_1788101077_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067661_1788101077_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260830/zhanbao_image_2067661_1788101077_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>利兹联1-1战平布伦特福德，两队双双两轮不败。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/match2057401date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">开局两连胜！国米1-0卡利亚里 恰20连场建功巴雷拉助攻 琼斯首秀</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9494f157ebenative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">意甲积分榜：国米、米兰、尤文、拉齐奥均取两连胜，分列1-4名</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.72" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2057401_1788121644_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.72" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.72" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2057401_1788121644_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260831/zhanbao_image_2057401_1788121644_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>国米1-0卡利亚里，联赛开局两连胜，恰尔汗奥卢打入全场唯一进球。</p><p>【转会新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a945ac7edeb1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方：新月签下维拉30岁前锋沃特金斯，转会费总价6040万欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.33" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310054232005_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.33" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.33" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310054232005_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310054232005_720.jpg"> </div><p>官方消息，新月签下维拉前锋沃特金斯，转会费总价6040万欧。据罗马诺消息，沃特金斯转会费为5840万欧元外加200万欧元浮动条款。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a947ef53b8bbnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">总价4500万欧！记者：切尔西签22岁中场卡马拉达原则性协议</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310305414608.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310305414608_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310305414608_720.jpg"> </div><p>记者Sacha Tavolieri独家消息，切尔西与摩纳哥就22岁中场拉明·卡马拉的转会达成原则性协议！转会费总价4500万欧，这个金额包含浮动奖金。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a945b30d392anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">Here We Go！罗马诺：维拉将签南安普顿后卫贝利斯，总价3000万镑</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310039508275_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310039508275_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310039508275_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺以标志性的“Here We Go”确认，维拉将签下南安普顿后卫泰勒·贝利斯，转会费总价3000万镑（约合3500万欧）。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9478d562ee1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺独家：马竞向尤文租借+选择买断报价戴维，球员愿意加盟</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.37" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310241416346_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.37" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.37" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310241416346_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310241416346_720.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺独家消息，马德里竞技已就戴维向尤文图斯送上正式报价。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a94a5e479bc8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">HWG！罗马诺：切尔西4000万镑后卫新援阿哈诺将外租至水晶宫</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310552077394_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310552077394_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310552077394_720.jpg"> </div><p>者罗马诺以here we go确认，切尔西后卫新援阿哈诺外租水晶宫。不久前，切尔西敲定支付4000万镑（4670万欧）将他从亚特兰大签下。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a949b91c360enative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">罗马诺：巴萨签热苏斯金额为1000万欧+400万欧浮动，20%二转分成</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251223/694ab3fcbd060.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251223/694ab3fcbd060.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251223/694ab3fcbd060.jpg"> </div><p>罗马诺报道，巴萨与阿森纳已经在着手交换热苏斯的相关转会文件，他同时进一步更新了交易细节。</p><p>【其他新闻】</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-30/6a9451f4bf498native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">首秀重伤！多特官方：康斯坦泰利亚斯左膝十字韧带撕裂，缺阵数月</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/202608302355138189.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/202608302355138189.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260830/202608302355138189.jpg"> </div><p>多特官方消息，新援康斯坦泰利亚斯左膝十字韧带撕裂，他在德甲首秀中遭遇重伤。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a94613bb465fnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">官方解释：马奎尔意外手球后射门明显偏出产生乌龙，进球应判有效</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.76" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310046054478.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.76" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.76" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310046054478_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310046054478_720.jpg"> </div><p>英超第二轮，曼联vs伊普斯维奇，马奎尔第56分钟反抢后射门制造伊镇后卫乌龙。英超官方随后对这球的判罚进行了解释。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a94707e81ed8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">分析机构：马奎尔明显故意手球，判进球有效是令人震惊的荒唐判罚</a></p><p>英超官方判罚，意外手球无法被处罚，并且进球来自乌龙，因此判罚进球有效。对此，分析机构Archivo VAR给出强烈质疑。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a946cbd23f57native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马奎尔谈乌龙争议：那并不是故意手球，我射门打偏了所以进球有效</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310150388585.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310150388585_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/202608310150388585_720.jpg"> </div><p>英超第二轮，曼联5-2逆转伊普斯维奇，马奎尔赛后接受天空体育采访，谈到了自己造乌龙的争议。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-08-31/6a9466b75d0f6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">穆帅：我们三场已进了10球，但有些比赛会1-0赢，我们仍会满意</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/6a945c65525aa_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/6a945c65525aa.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260831/6a945c65525aa.jpg"> </div><p>轮西甲，皇马4-0横扫马拉加，赛后，穆里尼奥接受皇马TV采访。</p><a href="http://m.zhibo8.cc/topic/index.html?id=165" class="hide" style="     background: url('http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_200905/zt_4221599266620.png') no-repeat;     background-size: cover;     display: block;     height: 150px;     max-width: 690px;     color: white;     margin: 24px auto;     position: relative;     border-radius: 10px;     overflow: hidden; ">     <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 50px;     line-height: 50px;     font-size: 16px;     left: 0;     bottom: 0;     right: 0;     text-indent: 15px;     background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);     color:white; ">直播吧足球早报-早看早知道</div>      <div style="     position: absolute;     height: 20px;     line-height: 20px;     font-size: 12px;     right: 10px;     top: 10px;     border-radius: 5px;     width: 40px;     text-align: center; 	background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);     color:white; ">专题</div> </a><script> 	$(function(){ 	    $(".video-bg").find('span').click(function(){/*视频播放*/             var _this = this;             var index = $(".video-bg span").index(this);             var MediaArr = document.getElementsByTagName("video");             $(this).parent().hide();             MediaArr[index].play();             MediaArr[index].controls = true;             $(".video-box").each(function(i, item) {                 if ($(this).find('span').get(0) !== _this) {                     $(this).find('.video-bg').show();                     MediaArr[i].pause();                     MediaArr[i].controls = false;                 }             })         });  	if(typeof(canLoadImage)=='function'){/*新版图片打开方式定义*/ 		if(!((typeof(getNetType)==='function' && getNetType()) || canLoadImage())){             $(".img_wrap").css('background-color', '#D9D9DA').find('.play_btn').css('text-indent','0');         } 		var platform = $('input[name="platform"]').val(); 		platform = platform=='ios'?'ios':'android'; 		var img_op = img_op_value = ''; 		function show_small_gif1(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 				img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 				var lineHeight = $(this).find('.play_btn').height();  				if((img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4||img_op_value==7)&&$(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){ 				    $(this).css('background-image',"url('"+$(this).attr("data-thumb")+"')"); 				    $(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('line-height', lineHeight + 'px').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}  		setTimeout(show_small_gif1(),100); 		/*load_type 1=wifi,2=4G&&loadimg,3=4G&&noloadimg*/ 		function load_img(this_obj,load_type,status) { 			img_op = get_img_op_attr(this_obj,platform); 			img_op_value = get_op(img_op,platform); 			/*var img = this_obj.children('img:first');*/ 			var img = this_obj.find('img:eq(0)'); 			if(load_type==1){ 				if(img_op_value==1 || img_op_value==7){ 					if(img.attr('t-rc')==img.attr('src')){ 						open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 					}else{ 						this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 						img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 					} 				}else if(status==1){ 					open_img(img_op_value,platform,img.attr('t-rc')); 				} 			}else if(load_type==2&&this_obj.attr('type')=='IMG'){ 				this_obj.find('.play_btn').hide(); 				img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')); 			} 			if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){                 img.load(function(){                     window.webkit.messageHandlers.imageLoaded.postMessage('test');                 }); 			}else if(platform=='ios'&&typeof(imageLoaded)=='function'){ 				img.load(function(){ 				    /*加载完成*/                     imageLoaded(); 				}); 			} 		}; 		 		var ms = 1000; 		if(platform === 'android'){ 		    ms = 10; 		} 		setTimeout(function(){ 			if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){/*wifi*/ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				load_img($(this),1,0) 				}); 			}else{ 				if(canLoadImage()){/*载入图片*/ 					$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 						load_img($(this),2,0) 					}); 			}else{ 				$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 					load_img($(this),3,0); 				}); 			} 			} 		}, ms);  		$(".img_wrap").click( 				function(){ 				    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url');                     if(jumpUrl){                         return openLink(jumpUrl);                     } 					load_img($(this),1,1); 					event.stopPropagation(); 				} 			); 		$('a').click(function(e){ 			img_op = get_img_op_attr($(this),platform); 			img_op_value = parseInt(get_op(img_op,platform)); 			if(img_op_value>=0&&img_op_value<=7){ 				open_img(img_op_value,platform,$(this).attr('href')); 				if ( e && e.preventDefault ) 					e.preventDefault(); 				else 					window.event.returnValue = false;  				return false; 			}     	}); 	}else{/*旧版本*/ 		function show_small_gif(){ 			$(".img_wrap").each(function(i){ 				/*console.log($(this).css('background-image'));*/ 				$(this).find('.play_btn').css("text-indent","0"); 				if($(this).attr("data-ratio") && /gif/i.test($(this).attr("type")) ){                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     $(this).css({width:"100%",height:0,"padding-top":100/ratio+"%"}).find(".play_btn").css({top:0,height:'100%'});                 } 				if($(this).attr("data-thumb")!=''){                     $(this).append('<img class="img-thumb" style="position: absolute;top: 0;left: 0;width: 100%;height: 100%;object-fit: cover;" src="'+ $(this).attr("data-thumb") +'" />'); 					$(this).find('.play_btn').html('').css('font-size','3em').css('color','white').css('background', 'url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/common/img/ic_gif_big@3x.png) no-repeat center center').css('background-size','104px'); 				} 			}); 		}; 		show_small_gif(); 		$(".img_wrap").click(function (event) { 		    var jumpUrl = $(this).attr('jump-url'); 			if(jumpUrl){ 				return openLink(jumpUrl); 			} 			if ($(this).attr('type') == 'IMG') {                 $(this).css("width", 'auto');                 $(this).css("height", 'auto');                 $(this).css("background", 'none');                 $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));                 event.stopPropagation();             }else{                 $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                 var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                 img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                     $(this).css({width:"auto",height:"auto","padding-top":0,background:"none"});                     $(this).find('.img-thumb').remove();                 }.bind(this));                 img.attr('data-src', img.attr('t-rc'));             } 		});  	    if(typeof(getNetType)=='function' && getNetType()){             /*$(".img_wrap").click();*/             setTimeout('$(".img_wrap").click()',200); 		}else{/*旧版非gif图片3G直接载入图片*/             $(".img_wrap").each(function(i){                 if($(this).attr('type')=='IMG'){                     var img = $(this).find('img:eq(0)');                     var ratio = $(this).attr("data-ratio");                     if(ratio){                         $(this).css({                             width:'100%',                             height:0,                            'padding-top':100/ratio+'%'                         }).find(".play_btn").css({                             top:0,                             height:'100%'                         });                         img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc')).on("load",function(){                           $(this).css({'padding-top':'0'}).find(".play_btn").hide();                         }.bind(this));                     }else{                       $(this).css("width", 'auto');                       $(this).css("height", 'auto');                       $(this).css("background", 'none');                       $(this).removeClass("img_wrap");                       $(this).find('.play_btn').hide();                       img.attr('src', img.attr('t-rc'));                    }                 }             }); 		} 	}  	function get_op(img_op,platform){ 		img_op_arr = img_op.split('|'); 		if(img_op_arr.length!=4)return 5; 		switch (platform){             case 'android' :                 value = img_op_arr[0].split('_');                 break;             case 'ios' :                 value = img_op_arr[1].split('_');                 break;             case 'wap' :                 value = img_op_arr[2].split('_');                 break;             case 'pc' :                 value = img_op_arr[3].split('_');                 break;             default :                 value = [5,''];         }         return value[0]; 	}  	function get_img_op_attr(img_ele,platform){ 		if(platform=='android'){ 			if(window.zhibo8OpenImage && window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 			if(window.webkit && window.webkit.messageHandlers && window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser){ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op_new'); 			}else{ 				op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 			} 		}else{ 			op_value = img_ele.attr('img_op'); 		} 		return op_value; 	} 	 	function openLink(aHref) {         if(!aHref) return;         var aNode = document.createElement('a');         aNode.href = aHref;         aNode.click();     }  	function open_img(img_op_value,platform,src){ /*		if(!(img_op_value==1||img_op_value==2||img_op_value==3||img_op_value==4)){ 			return false; 		}*/ 		/*if(src=''||src==undefine)return;*/ 		if(img_op_value==1){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openNativeImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openNativeImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==2){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openImageLinkWebBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openImageLinkWebBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==3){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openWebViewImageBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openWebViewImageBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==4){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openSystemWebViewBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		}else if(img_op_value==7){ 			if(platform=='android'){ 				window.zhibo8OpenImage.openInnerExplorerBrowser(src); 			}else if(typeof(getJSType)=='function' && getJSType()){ 				window.webkit.messageHandlers.openInnerExplorerBrowser.postMessage(src); 			}else{ 				openSystemWebViewBrowser(src); 			} 		} 	} 	}) </script><style>.video-box{position:relative;}.video-bg{position: absolute;z-index: 8 !important;width: 100%;height: 100%;background-color: transparent;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -2.94em;margin-top:  -2.94em;width: 5.88em;height: 5.88em;background: url(https://static4style.duoduocdn.com/m_images/inside/outs/ic_play@2x.png) center/46px no-repeat;}.video-bg span{position: absolute;width: 100px;height: 100px;left: 50%;top:50%;margin-left: -50px;margin-top:  -50px;}</style>
